/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
2147 0 obj
<<
/Alt ()
/E (When using an evacuated tube, choose one that collects a small volume \(1 ml or 5 ml\) and has a low vacuum; this helps to avoid collapse of the vein and may decrease haemolysis.)
/K [20]
/P 6236 0 R
/Pg 39 0 R
/S /P
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
2148 0 obj
<<
