/Pg 40 0 R
/S /H4
/T (Ask whether the parent would like to help by holding the child. If the parent wishes to help, provide full instructions on how and where to hold the child; if the parent prefers not to help, ask for assistance from another phlebotomist.)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
