/Alt ()
/E (Customers are responsible for ensuring that specimens are stored at the required temperatures while awaiting pickup by one of our Logistics Representatives. Proper storage is essential to maintain the integrity of the specimens. Refer to our online Directory of Services \(DoS\) for detailed information on the required specimen storage temperatures to ensure proper handling and preservation.  )
