/Alt ()
/E (Mismatched specimens and/ or requisitions - Specimens which are labelled with the wrong patient's name compared to that of the accompanying requisition or with a different patient's ID number, the same criteria as for Unlabeled Specimens apply. The patient/customer is notified and requested to identify the sample. If the information is not received before the sample retention period, the sample will be rejected and discarded as per set criteria/procedures.)
