3354 0 obj
<<
/Alt ()
/E (Samples collected for cytological and histopathological examination- Cytology specimens such as body fluids are stored till 24 hours after dispatch of reports. Stained slides are retained for a period of minimum 5 years. Wet tissues like histopathology specimens are stored for at least 4 weeks after dispatch of reports. Slides and blocks from these tissues are stored for 10 years. This is in accordance with Guidelines issued by College of American Pathologists.  Specific storage conditions, detailed protocols and procedures are cited in the specimen collection and handling manual of the Department of Pathology.)
/K [21]
/P 6587 0 R
/Pg 83 0 R
/S /P
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
