/T (PACKAGING OF WASTES)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
3820 0 obj
<<
/Alt ()
/E (Torn, damaged, or leaking containers must be overpacked by placing them within a second, intact container to prevent spillage, ensure safe handling, and maintain compliance with biomedical waste management protocols.)
/K [11]
/P 6947 0 R
/Pg 91 0 R
/S /P
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
3821 0 obj
<<
