>>
endobj
3837 0 obj
<<
/Alt ()
/E (Whenever possible, specimens should be obtained before antibiotics or other antimicrobial agents have been administered. Please indicate the source of the specimen on the test to better assist in your diagnosis and treatment of the patient. )
/K [13]
/Pg 92 0 R
