/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
3838 0 obj
<<
/Alt ()
/E (Not all specimens contain clinically significant pathogens. Organism identification and antimicrobial susceptibility studies will be performed only on appropriate isolates at an additional charge.)
/K [14]
